          "html": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">When the window gets narrower this paragraph wraps onto more lines than its rows hold. The browser stretches those rows to fit the text, and everything below moves down. Start a drag anywhere in this section and the editor first converts the stretched rows back into uniform rows, so every snap moves the same distance.</p>",
